instruction:
Stage collect_identity. Look up the directory profile of the user named in the alert. Choose exactly one read-only tool from the list and respond with JSON: {"tool": "<name>", "arguments": {...}}.
Tools:
- search_siem_events: Search SIEM events by free text. arguments: {"query": {"type": "string"}}
- get_identity_profile: Fetch the directory profile of a user. arguments: {"user_id": {"type": "string"}}
- get_authentication_history: List recent sign-ins of a user. arguments: {"user_id": {"type": "string"}, "limit": {"type": "integer"}}
- get_endpoint_status: Fetch endpoint posture and EDR alerts. arguments: {"endpoint_id": {"type": "string"}}
- lookup_indicator: Look up an IP or domain in threat intelligence. arguments: {"indicator": {"type": "string"}}
